cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these scripts, please cite them as below."
title: "FASTA Utilities: helper scripts for renaming, splitting and trimming FASTA files"
abstract: "Three small Python scripts for tidying FASTA files: ConvertTextToFasta renames FASTA files saved as .txt after checking they are FASTA; split_major_fastas splits one-file-per-gene FASTA files into one file per gene per specimen; trim_fasta_trailing_whitespace removes trailing whitespace from the end of FASTA files."
